</given-names></name><name><surname>Yasui</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kishi</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Primary intracranial germinoma in the medulla oblongata</article-title><source>Surg Neurol</source><year>2000</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>448</fpage><lpage>451</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10874143</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yoshida</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakao</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamamoto</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Mori</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Maeda</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Germinoma in the fourth ventricle</article-title><source>Acta Neurochir (Wien)</source><year>2003</year><volume>145</volume><fpage>789</fpage><lpage>792</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14505107</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Marsden</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><name><surname>Obeso</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Zarranz</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lang</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The anatomical basis of symptomatic hemidystonia</article-title><source>Brain</source><year>1995</year><volume>108</volume><fpage>463</fpage><lpage>483</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4005532</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Obeso</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Gimenez-Roldan</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-grou